sitions", "function": null}, {"name": "expressed:", "function": null}, {"name": "NAFOs’ representatives outlined their position on the EUDR", "function": null}, {"name": "and reported on implementation challenges for small and", "function": null}, {"name": "medium forest-owners. They reported on NAFO’s activities to", "function": null}, {"name": "facilitate the implementation of the EUDR for their members,", "function": null}, {"name": "arguing that the IT system still presents challenges.", "function": null}, {"name": "Cabinet Dombrovskis outlined the key elements of the EUDR", "function": null}, {"name": "amending proposal adopted by the Commission on 21 October", "function": null}, {"name": "2025.", "function": null}, {"name": "Conclusions: Cabinet Dombrovskis took note of NAFOs’ position on EUDR", "function": null}, {"name": "and presented the proposal adopted on 21 October 2025.", "function": null}, {"name": "EUROPEAN COMMISSION", "function": null}]}

