Competitiveness", "cabinet_member": "Dorota Denning", "minutes_url": "https://ec.europa.eu/transparencyinitiative/meetings/exportmeetings.do?doc=0ccaf768-3b79-4314-bbb8-ac37d65848ad&host=no", "source_url": "https://ec.europa.eu/transparencyinitiative/meetings/meeting.do?host=8e3988b4-1258-4448-add5-000bbe0c2848&page=34", "actor_id": "COM_00006A32D620", "commissioner_name": "Valdis Dombrovskis", "commissioner_portfolio": "economy, productivity, implementing and simplifying EU law in the second von der Leyen Commission", "host_id": "8e3988b4-1258-4448-add5-000bbe0c2848", "meeting_type": "cabinet", "id": "39c132ff3d348e71", "minutes_subject": "Simplification agenda Competitiveness", "points_raised": "The Federation of the Food and Drink Industries representatives outlined the structure of their Federation and the nature of business of their members. They explained the impact the current regulation of sustainability reporting and deforestation has on their businesses, and the way it affects their SME members upstream through supply chains. They drew attention to regulatory inefficiencies they are facing in this way. The Member of Cabinet listened to the concerns and explained the focus of the new Commission’s mandate related to implementation, simplification and competitiveness including the process through which it will be implemented in the current mandate.", "conclusions": "The Member of Cabinet invited the representatives to consider contributing to the relevant implementation dialogues and reality checks when they are organised by the Commissioners and DGs responsible for each topic.", "ares_number": "Ares(2024)8822577", "transparency_register_ids": [], "commission_representatives": [{"name": "(s):", "function": null}, {"name": "Dorota Denning", "function": "Member of Cabinet"}, {"name": "Name(s) of the", "function": null}, {"name": "interest", "function": null}, {"name": "representative(s):", "function": null}, {"name": "Dana Večeřová, President of the Federation 