e timeline for the re-", "function": null}, {"name": "negotiations of the Inter-Institutional Agreement on Better", "function": null}, {"name": "Lawmaking. They asked about the scope of the upcoming", "function": null}, {"name": "Omnibus proposal and stressed the importance of reducing", "function": null}, {"name": "administrative burden.", "function": null}, {"name": "Conclusions: The Commission listened to the instances expressed by", "function": null}, {"name": "Confindustria and BDI and indicated that work was on-going to", "function": null}, {"name": "explore avenues for simplification on various acts, in the", "function": null}, {"name": "context of the upcoming omnibus simplification package", "function": null}, {"name": "EUROPEAN COMMISSION", "function": null}]}

